51
00:03:39,831 --> 00:03:42,830
[The all-rounders of SUPER JUNIOR]

52
00:03:42,830 --> 00:03:45,864
[The K-POP textbook]
[Lee Teuk, Shin Dong]

53
00:03:45,864 --> 00:03:47,830
[A genre unmatched by anyone else]

54
00:03:47,830 --> 00:03:50,930
