55
00:03:50,930 --> 00:03:53,764
[The irreplaceable solo artist, DAWN]

56
00:03:53,764 --> 00:03:57,430
[Commanding presence on the stage]

57
00:03:57,430 --> 00:03:59,830
[The hot guy from Chicago,
blessed with superior genes]

58
00:03:59,830 --> 00:04:02,663
[The NCT 127 member
with perfect physique, Johnny]

59
00:04:03,698 --> 00:04:07,330
[Here comes
the super big, super cute puppy]

60
00:04:07,330 --> 00:04:09,696
[Perfect down to his soulful eyes]

61
00:04:09,696 --> 00:04:11,663
[Visuals that tell a story, WEi's Yo Han]

62
00:04:11,663 --> 00:04:14,464
[Baby hamster]
[Hidden behind that cute boy vibe]

63
00:04:14,464 --> 00:04:17,489
[The powerful moves
of a main dancer]

64
00:04:17,489 --> 00:04:20,263
[NCT DREAM's Youngest on Top, Ji Sung]

65
00:04:20,263 --> 00:04:22,999
[So, why are WANGGEOZ here together?]

66
00:04:23,830 --> 00:04:25,439
[The princes and the paupers
will be decided through a variety of games!]

67
00:04:25,439 --> 00:04:27,531
Get it together, get it together!

68
00:04:27,531 --> 00:04:29,123
